<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  {{>head}}
  <body>
    <main>
      <table {{{containerstyle}}}>
        <tr>
          <td>{{> header}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>
            <table class="mobile-width" {{{bodytablestyle}}}>
              <tr>
                <td
                  style="
                    padding: 40px 30px;
                    font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
                  "
                >
                  <div
                    style="
                      font-size: 20px;
                      font-weight: 700;
                      color: #1d1c1d;
                      letter-spacing: -0.25px;
                      line-height: 28px;
                      margin: 0 0 16px 0;
                    "
                  >
                    The upgrade grace ends on {{endsOn}}
                  </div>
                  <div
                    style="
                      font-size: 15px;
                      font-weight: 400;
                      color: #434245;
                      line-height: 22px;
                      margin: 0 0 24px 0;
                    "
                  >
                    <div>
                      No license key is in force on this {{productName}} installation. Company-wide
                      connectors that copy access from their sources keep doing so for
                      <strong>{{daysLeft}} more {{#if oneDay}}day{{else}}days{{/if}}</strong>, until
                      <strong>{{endsOn}}</strong>.
                    </div>
                    <div style="height: 12px; line-height: 12px;">&nbsp;</div>
                    <div>
                      After that, without a license key, each of them is limited to the person who
                      created it until a key is installed. Nothing is deleted.
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div style="margin: 0 0 32px 0;">
                    <a
                      href="{{{link}}}"
                      target="_blank"
                      style="
                        display: inline-block;
                        background-color: #006949;
                        color: #ffffff;
                        font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
                        font-size: 16px;
                        font-weight: 500;
                        line-height: 24px;
                        text-decoration: none;
                        padding: 8px 16px;
                        border-radius: 3px;
                      "
                    >Install a license key</a>
                  </div>
                  <div
                    style="
                      font-size: 13px;
                      font-weight: 400;
                      color: #868686;
                      line-height: 20px;
                      border-top: 1px solid #e8e8e8;
                      padding-top: 16px;
                      margin-top: 8px;
                    "
                  >
                    You get this because you are an admin of this installation. Admins are mailed
                    14, 7, 3 and 1 days before the grace ends.
                  </div>
                </td>
              </tr>
            </table>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>{{> footer}}</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
